        <groundspeak:log id="1187379039">
          <groundspeak:date>2023-08-11T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP669 Mirror [FOUND] &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First of four caps today (not counting two great benchmarks on Flagstaff Hill near my target cache of the day.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This cap is fairly beat up but has lots of billboards to talk to if it wishes. I found easy parking from which I logged both this and the nearby traditional. TFTBC. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="702668757">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-07-15T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
